      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T19:05:42.452553+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.5.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri asks what this means for a new situation. Knowledge becomes portable."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.5.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri si chiede cosa questo significhi per una nuova situazione. La conoscenza diventa portatile.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.5.desc-2026-07-09T19:05:42.452553+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.5.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-09T19:05:42.452553+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T19:05:42.452553+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "You\\'re at the creek bank. Before we measure anything — what\\'s the first thing you notice about the water right here versus ten feet upstream?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Sei sulla riva del fiume. Prima di misurare qualsiasi cosa - qual è la prima cosa che noti sull'acqua qui rispetto a dieci piedi a monte?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-09T19:05:42.452553+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-09T19:05:42.452553+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T19:05:42.452553+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "It\\'s slower here and there\\'s more mud on the bottom."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Qui è più lento e c'è più fango in fondo.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-09T19:05:42.452553+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-09T19:06:04.912471+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T19:06:04.912471+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Good observation. Why do you think the mud settled here and not upstream where the water is faster?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Ottima osservazione. Perché pensi che il fango si sia depositato qui e non a monte dove l'acqua scorre più veloce?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-09T19:06:04.912471+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-09T19:06:04.912471+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T19:06:04.912471+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Maybe slower water can\\'t carry as much stuff?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Forse l'acqua più lenta non può trasportare molte cose?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-09T19:06:04.912471+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-09T19:06:04.912471+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T19:06:04.912471+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "That\\'s the right direction. What could you measure or photograph here to support that idea?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Questa è la direzione giusta. Cosa potresti misurare o fotografare qui per sostenere questa idea?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-09T19:06:04.912471+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text"
      }
    },
